# A mana ability activated while paying (CR 601.2g) may tap a creature that has no mana ability of its own: Springleaf
# Drum's "{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Add one mana of any color." Bot1's only creature, Ornithopter, is
# untapped, but the Drum could tap it, so web-slinging is offered against Bot2's Lightning Bolt. The Drum taps the
# Ornithopter for {U}, and the Ornithopter, now tapped, is the creature returned (CR 702.188a; ruling 2025-09-19).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Springleaf Drum
Ornithopter
Spider-Sense
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

